record legeos.papercut.building-the-metapackages-with-dpkg-deb-from-a/1 : papercut {
    title "Building the metapackages with dpkg-deb from a staging tree under…"
    state superseded
    statement """
        Building the metapackages with dpkg-deb from a staging tree under target/ failed with "control directory has bad permissions 777": the checkout is on NTFS, where every directory reports 0777 and chmod is a no-op. Staging moved to the system temp dir; anything else that hands dpkg a directory tree from this checkout will hit the same wall.
        """
