record legeos.papercut.on-the-qemu-boot-of-the-first-iso-the-live/1 : papercut {
    title "On the QEMU boot of the first ISO the live preflight fails…"
    state superseded
    statement """
        On the QEMU boot of the first ISO the live preflight fails preflight-render-node (bochs-drm has no /dev/dri/renderD*), so legeos-install would refuse a VM install without --ignore-preflight; a virtio-gpu device in provision-qemu.sh/iso-qemu.sh, or treating a missing render node as a warning, would keep the VM route honest.
        """
    observed_at git:31b1a737b4748f675498539a68de3595ec46097f
    author "claude"
    created_at 2026-09-07
}

