    state superseded
    statement """
        templar-resourced reported level=severe from 01:00:18 to 01:00:49 on boot a2228e0a with about 28 GiB MemAvailable, because global memory full avg10 was 0.41-0.84 and the default severe_full_avg10 is 0.5; its once-a-second INFO 'tick' line carries only the level, so the journal alone cannot show why (traces.jsonl had the numbers).
        """
