record legeos.papercut.the-actual-native-firmware-interruption-attempt/1 : papercut {
    title "The actual native firmware interruption attempt observed Downloading…"
    state verified
    statement """
        The actual native firmware interruption attempt observed Downloading then AwaitingReboot and missed Staging; the real Current API serializes behind the synchronous transaction step. No interruption proof was claimed. Switch the disposable guest observer to the persisted native journal, preserving this failed attempt log and starting an independent clone from the completed rollback snapshot.
        """
    observed_at git:7c68786687bea7b20dbc382bdacc2804e7284b70
    author "Main"
    created_at 2026-10-06
