    state verified
    statement """
        The native filed metadata regression acquired Observe before the daemon had claimed its bus name; ServiceUnknown was a fixture startup race, fixed by awaiting Roots first. RenderNative uses shell-quoted (not shell), and the bulk tree decoder requires extended coverage/aggregate fields; discover these typed contracts before constructing smoke requests.
        """
    observed_at git:7c68786687bea7b20dbc382bdacc2804e7284b70
    author "codex"
