record legeos.papercut.triaging-the-2026-10-01-freeze-as-the-desktop/1 : papercut {
    title "Triaging the 2026-10-01 freeze as the desktop user: `journalctl -k`…"
    state superseded
    statement """
        Triaging the 2026-10-01 freeze as the desktop user: `journalctl -k` printed nothing and no error, because provision.sh created the account in sudo,video,render only (not adm/systemd-journal), so every kernel and system-unit line of the frozen boot needed sudo. provision.sh now adds adm; machines installed earlier need scripts/freeze-evidence-setup.sh.
        """
    observed_at git:50af3784cb5c3f0ebe72a1e15f12a88f57e11290
    author "sonnet-triage"
    created_at 2026-10-01
}

